The source code of this project is published on GitHub so that the free
tier of GitHub Pages can serve the site, and so that users can inspect what
this tool actually does — a driving-alert program that continuously reads
your location ought to be inspectable.

**Public visibility does not grant a licence.** Except as expressly permitted
below, no part of this project may be reproduced, modified, distributed,
