service, without the prior written consent of the copyright holder.

Expressly permitted:

1. Viewing the source on GitHub and using GitHub's fork feature (rights
   granted by the GitHub Terms of Service).
2. Running the published web or application build on your own device for
   personal, non-commercial purposes.
3. Quoting code excerpts as strictly necessary to report an issue or make a
